  {"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {}, "source": ["### 1. 🟢 Analytical Solution of Linear System\nSolve the 2D linear system of ODEs $\\frac{d\\mathbf{y}}{dt} = A\\mathbf{y}$ where $A = \\begin{bmatrix} -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 \\end{bmatrix}$ with initial condition $\\mathbf{y}(0) = [2, -3]^T$. Compare with scipy's `solve_ivp` numerical solution."]},
